    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.660" end="00:03.390" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love myself</p>
      <p begin="00:03.390" end="00:07.880" ttm:agent="v1">난 좋을 때도 나쁠 때도, love my weakness</p>
      <p begin="00:07.880" end="00:11.600" ttm:agent="v1">화려했던 기대와는 달리 왠지</p>
      <p begin="00:11.600" end="00:17.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">볼품없다 해도, find the good parts, the good parts (ah)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.890" end="00:19.670" ttm:agent="v1">얄궂은 phone 화면 위로</p>
      <p begin="00:19.670" end="00:22.640" ttm:agent="v1">애꿎은 내 손가락만, tick, tick</p>
      <p begin="00:22.640" end="00:26.490" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, my, 기분은 falling down</p>
      <p begin="00:26.490" end="00:34.490" ttm:agent="v1">Pic of mine, zoom in, out, pretend I'm fine</p>
      <p begin="00:34.590" end="00:37.030" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love myself</p>
      <p begin="00:37.030" end="00:41.400" ttm:agent="v1">난 좋을 때도 나쁠 때도, love my weakness</p>
      <p begin="00:41.400" end="00:45.260" ttm:agent="v1">화려했던 기대와는 달리 왠지</p>
      <p begin="00:45.260" end="00:50.390" ttm:agent="v1">볼품없다 해도, find the good parts, the good parts</p>
      <p begin="00:50.390" end="00:51.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh-ooh-ooh-ooh)</p>
